title: Every Button
id: zap
tab: 18 · Every Button
about: 18 · Zap has a button for everything (and no idea what any of them do), turning big console Hertz and slim 12:00 Tracker into unwitting victims before a 28-button xylophone finale
lead: zap
key: C
bpm: 122
backing:
bass: none
stage: zap, hertz, tracker
finale: "Zap" on 7

